{"id":"en_fruit-glory-summit","title":"Fruit Glory Summit","titleEn":"Fruit Glory Summit","description":"The World Cup turns into a martial-arts arena where football stars become brightly colored fruit warriors. France, Argentina, Croatia and Poland all chase the title, and Poland's Team D, trained in Paris, proves especially strong as a unit. The series mixes intense battles with genuine bonds of friendship, giving the tournament a lighthearted, playful spin. Viewers can follow the series and its episodes on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fruit-glory-summit/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fruit-glory-summit/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Athlete","Fantasy","General","Melodrama","Sport","Warrior"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6bou/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fruit-glory-summit_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6bou/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fruit-glory-summit_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6bou/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fruit-glory-summit_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6bou/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fruit-glory-summit_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d6bou/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fruit-glory-summit_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rum